by>近視<rp>(</rp><rt>きんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なので、あの<ruby>看板<rp>(</rp><rt>かんばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いてあるか<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我看得很近,所以我不知道这封信上写着什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">近所</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんじょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">邻近；附近；周围</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120461\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>近所<rp>(</rp><rt>きんじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>越<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他搬到了我家附近。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/833192\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">禁じる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">禁止；禁令；禁绝；抑制；压抑；忍住</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90550\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>喫煙<rp>(</rp><rt>きつえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>禁<rp>(</rp><rt>きん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她被禁止吸烟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">禁ずる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんずる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">禁止；禁绝；取缔；抑制；压抑；忍住</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196804\">ベッドでの<ruby>煙草<rp>(</rp><rt>たばこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>禁<rp>(</rp><rt>きん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずる<ruby>厳<rp>(</rp><rt>きび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>規則<rp>(</rp><rt>きそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在床上禁止吸烟的严格规则。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金銭</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">金钱；现金</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179651\"><ruby>金銭<rp>(</rp><rt>きんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことで<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>争<rp>(</rp><rt>あらそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我和他争论了金钱。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金属</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんぞく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">金属</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">近代</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">现代；当代；近代（日本历史时期，通常指明治维新至第二次世界大战结束）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179801\"><ruby>近代<rp>(</rp><rt>きんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>医学<rp>(</rp><rt>いがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>進歩<rp>(</rp><r